{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is detected, approach it. Then, take, check properties, process it. Finally, move to location. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    />",
